 "push_note": "100 fixed test tasks; each goal is the end of a 30-step push from the start. Success = block within 3 px of its target within 60 steps; long = the block must move 20 px or more. Mean \u00b1 std over 3 training seeds. Final-state cost = CEM scores only the last imagined state (running_w 0); the running cost also averages distance along the plan. With the 8-step prediction loss the running cost hurts (it penalises the detours long pushes need); with 1- or 2-step losses it helps (sweep below)."
